If a patient chooses an opioid-taper and cannot taper an opioid then every clinician may reassess an opioid-use-disorder for the patient.
If a patient chooses an opioid-taper and cannot taper an opioid and has an opioid-use-disorder-criteria-match then every clinician may offer a buprenorphine-treatment to the patient and may refer the patient for a buprenorphine-treatment and may refer the patient for a methadone-treatment.
